/**
 * prescription-generator.js
 * High-performance, modular client-side Medical Prescription & Clinical Pad Generator
 * 
 * Features:
 * - Zero server footprint: 100% client-side privacy for psychiatric and clinical records.
 * - Exact typography and layout replicating institutional hospital pads (e.g. Ibn Sina Hospital standard).
 * - Full bi-directional / mixed English and Bengali typography support with 'Purno' font.
 * - Dynamic color pickers for academic appointments (crimson red) and clinical specialty (deep navy).
 * - Dosage pattern matrix helpers for rapid South Asian prescription entries (১+০+১, ১/২+০+০, চলবে, etc.).
 * - Section visibility toggles for the clinical left-sidebar.
 * - Direct in-memory vector/high-DPI PDF compilation via jsPDF (standard A4 portrait [210mm, 297mm]).
 * - LocalStorage persistence for doctor qualifications, footer data, and layout settings.
 * - One-click plain text prescription copying for WhatsApp/SMS tele-consultations.
 */

